            "name": "Telescopic Arms",
            "id": "ae63-1103-acee-49e9",
            "description": "The plod bot can make close combat attacks against a target up to 6” away with a Melee action but cannot benefit from charging if it does so. At the end of this close combat, the two models are not required to take Melee actions again, and the plod bot is not moved closer to a pushed back enemy. The target may leave close combat in its turn without any penalties for fleeing.",
